      "notes": "Catalog: \"Upper-division courses must total thirteen four-unit courses (totaling fifty-two units).\" 13 = 11 required courses above (counting the three EDS practicum courses) + 2 electives; a student using EDS 136 and EDS 138 in place of EDS 129A takes one more course in the practicum."
