     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Upper-division courses must include at least one two-quarter sequence from the following list: MATH 100A-B; 103A-B, 103A-102; 104A-B; 110-120A; 110-130; 112A-B; 120A-B; 120A-130; 121A-B; 140A-B; 142A-B; 150A-B; 154-184; 154-188; 155A-B; 158-184; 158-188; 160A-B; 170A-B; 170A-175; 170A-171A; 170A-179; 171A-B; 173A-B; 180A-B; 180A-181A; 190A-B; 193A-B. (The sequence may use courses counted above.)"
     }
